          <p class="muted" style="font-size:12.5px;margin-top:8px">ساخته‌شده از همین ابعاد هنگام انتشار؛ نیازی به تصویر نیست.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card__h">انتشار و نمایه‌سازی {{ pin(7) }}</div>
        <div class="card__b grid" style="gap:10px">
          <div class="field"><span class="lbl">وضعیت</span><div style="display:flex;gap:14px"><span class="radio">پیش‌نویس</span><span class="radio on">منتشرشده</span><span class="radio">بایگانی</span></div></div>
          <span class="tog on">نمایش در کاوشگر محصول</span>
          <div><span class="chk on">تأییدشده برای نمایه‌سازی <span class="muted">(فقط مالک)</span></span>
            <div class="gate"><span class="muted">شرط: همه ابعاد هسته منبع داشته باشند</span><div class="row"><span class="good code">d ✓</span><span class="good code">D ✓</span><span class="good code">B ✓</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="field"><span class="lbl">نتیجه در سایت</span><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="outcome">index, follow</span><span class="outcome">sitemap ✓</span><span class="outcome">Product schema (no Offer)</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card__h">منبع سریع {{ pin(8) }}</div>
        <div class="card__b grid" style="gap:8px">
          <div class="field"><label>عنوان</label><span class="a-in is-ph">مثلاً کاتالوگ عمومی سازنده</span></div>
          <div class="grid g2" style="gap:8px"><div class="field"><label>ناشر</label><span class="a-in is-ph">—</span></div><div class="field"><label>ویرایش / سال</label><span class="a-in is-ph">—</span></div></div>
          <div class="field"><label>نشانی یا فایل PDF</label><span class="a-in is-ph" dir="ltr">https://…</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endcall %}
</div>
<ol class="notes">
  <li><span><b>Same structure as the public workspace</b> (Overview · Dimensions &amp; data · Media · Documents · SEO). Overview holds summary, applications and notes, with fa and en fields side by side.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Designation and aliases drive search.</b> Aliases are entered explicitly, never guessed, and must be unique across the catalogue (validated on save).</span></li>
  <li><span><b>One SpecValue row per value</b>, each with value, unit, Source, check date and an is_placeholder flag. Provenance is per value, as in Gate 1.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Spec keys come from a controlled list per family</b>, which also tells the drawing template which values are core. There are no free-text keys, so tables, drawings and search stay consistent.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Optional values</b> left empty never render. Values with no source show publicly as "pending". Inline validation: numbers only, units separate, sanity checks such as D &gt; d.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>The drawing preview</b> comes from the same dimensions the Publish Engine will use, so no image is needed. The readout matches the public workspace exactly.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Status, explorer visibility and "Verified for indexing" are separate controls.</b> The verified checkbox is Owner-only and stays disabled until every core dimension cites a Source. The panel shows the resulting robots, sitemap and schema outcome.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Sources are reusable entities</b> (title, publisher, edition or year, URL or file). They can be created inline here and picked for any value.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Unsaved-change guard:</b> leaving the page with edits asks first. Save never touches the live site. The model has no price, stock or purchase fields at all.</span></li>
</ol>
{% endcall %}

{# ───────────────────────── A4 MEDIA ───────────────────────── #}
{% call screen('A4', 'media', 'Media library', 'رسانه', 'Every uploaded file is validated, converted once and reference-counted. Visitors only ever receive pre-sized files from the local disk.') %}
<div class="frame-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="A4 Media library wireframe">
{% call shell('media') %}
  <div class="adm__head"><div><p class="crumbs">محتوا</p><h3>رسانه <span class="sub">۲۳ فایل</span></h3></div><div class="actions"><span class="a-btn">سطل بازیافت (۳۰ روز)</span><span class="a-btn a-btn--pri">بارگذاری</span></div></div>
  <div class="drop"><div class="ph" style="width:64px;height:48px"><span>↑</span></div><div><b>فایل‌ها را اینجا رها کنید یا انتخاب کنید {{ pin(1) }}</b><p class="muted">JPEG، PNG، WebP، SVG، PDF · تصویر تا ۱۰ مگابایت · PDF تا ۲۰ مگابایت · تصاویر به WebP در چهار عرض تبدیل و فراداده حذف می‌شود</p></div></div>
  <div class="toolbar"><span class="a-in a-in--search is-ph">جستجوی نام یا متن جایگزین…</span><span class="chip on">همه</span><span class="chip">تصویر</span><span class="chip">PDF</span><span class="chip">SVG</span><span class="chip">بدون متن جایگزین ۴ {{ pin(2) }}</span><span class="chip">بدون استفاده ۱</span></div>
  <div class="grid g-main g-main--wide">
    <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px">
      {% for m in media %}
      <div class="mtile {% if m.sel %}sel{% endif %}">
        <div class="ph {% if m.pdf %}ph--pdf{% endif %}">{% if m.pdf %}<b>PDF</b>{% else %}<span class="num">{{ m.dim }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
        <span class="fn">{{ m.fn }}</span>
        <span class="meta"><span class="num">{{ m.size }}</span>{% if m.pages %} · {{ m.pages }}{% endif %}{% if m.refs %} · {{ fa(m.refs) }} ارجاع{% endif %}</span>
        {% if m.noalt or m.unused %}<span class="meta">{% if m.noalt %}<span class="badge b-pend">بدون متن جایگزین</span>{% endif %}{% if m.unused %}<span class="badge b-draft">بی‌استفاده</span>{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card__h">جزئیات فایل</div>
      <div class="card__b grid" style="gap:12px">
        <div class="ph" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><span>پیش‌نمایش</span></div>
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>نام فایل</dt><dd class="mono" dir="ltr" style="text-align:end;font-size:12px">6205-section-a1b2c3d4.webp</dd>
          <dt>نوع · ابعاد</dt><dd><span class="num">WebP · 1600 × 1200</span></dd>
          <dt>نسخه‌ها {{ pin(3) }}</dt><dd><span class="num">320 · 640 · 1024 · 1600 + JPEG 640</span></dd>
          <dt>حجم (۶۴۰)</dt><dd><span class="num">38 KB</span></dd>
        </dl>
        <div class="field"><label>متن جایگزین · فارسی <span class="bad">*</span></label><span class="a-in">مقطع بلبرینگ ساچمه‌ای 6205</span></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Alt text · English <span class="bad">*</span></label><span class="a-in is-err" dir="ltr"></span><span class="err">برای استفاده عمومی لازم است</span></div>
        <div class="field"><label>کپشن (اختیاری) fa / en</label><span class="a-in is-ph">—</span></div>
        <div class="field"><span class="lbl">استفاده‌شده در {{ pin(4) }}</span>
          <ul class="list" style="border:1px solid var(--rule-2)"><li><span class="grow">محصول <span class="code">6205</span> · نمای کلی</span><a class="a-btn a-btn--link">باز کردن</a></li><li><span class="grow">بخش «خانواده‌ها» · کارت ساچمه‌ای</span><a class="a-btn a-btn--link">باز کردن</a></li></ul></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="a-btn">جایگزینی در همان محل {{ pin(5) }}</span><span class="a-btn a-btn--danger" aria-disabled="true">حذف</span></div>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:12.5px">حذف ممکن نیست: این فایل ۲ ارجاع دارد. ابتدا ارجاع‌ها را بردارید.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endcall %}
</div>
<ol class="notes">
  <li><span><b>Upload pipeline (section J):</b> MIME sniffing plus magic bytes, re-decoding, strict SVG sanitising, content-hash rename, EXIF strip and auto-orient, then 320/640/1024/1600 widths. Limits are configurable and capped by the host's upload_max_filesize, which the probe will confirm.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Alt text in fa and en is required</b> before an image can appear publicly. Publish validation lists any image that is missing it.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Variants and dimensions are recorded</b>, so public pages always get width/height (zero CLS) and srcset. If the host lacks WebP or AVIF support, optimised JPEG/PNG is used instead.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Reference counting:</b> "Used by" lists every entity that points at the file. Delete is blocked while any reference exists. Unreferenced files go to a 30-day trash before physical deletion.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Replace in place</b> keeps every reference and changes the hash, so caches refresh without editing any product.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>PDF datasheets</b> appear as Document entities, with title, language, version, product and family links, and show their size and page count publicly. There is no in-page viewer.</span></li>
</ol>
{% endcall %}

