          <li><span class="avatar" style="background:#6b7397">و</span><span class="grow"><b>ویرایشگر</b><br><span class="muted" style="font-size:12.5px">محتوا، رسانه، استعلام‌ها، انتشار</span></span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card__h">پشتیبان‌گیری {{ pin(7) }}</div>
        <div class="card__b grid" style="gap:8px">
          <dl class="kv"><dt>آخرین</dt><dd>امروز ۰۳:۰۰ <span class="badge b-ok">موفق</span></dd><dt>نگه‌داری</dt><dd>۷ روزانه · ۴ هفتگی · ۳ ماهانه</dd><dt>خارج از سرور</dt><dd class="warn">۸ روز پیش — موعد گذشته</dd></dl>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="a-btn">دانلود پشتیبان کامل</span><span class="a-btn a-btn--danger">بازیابی…</span></div>
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:12.5px">بازیابی فقط توسط مالک؛ پیش از آن خودکار یک پشتیبان ایمنی گرفته می‌شود و سایت عمومی در تمام مدت سرویس می‌دهد.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endcall %}
</div>
<ol class="notes">
  <li><span><b>Single source:</b> CompanySetting feeds the header call button, contact section, footer, Organization/LocalBusiness structured data and every wa.me/tel: link. Change it once, then Publish.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Phone normalisation:</b> stored as E.164, displayed in grouped Latin digits in both languages (Q2), with links built automatically. Typing Persian digits or spaces is accepted and normalised.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Unknown stays unknown:</b> each day is open, closed or unknown. 08:00–16:00 is verified; the frame shows it on Saturday–Wednesday, which still needs your confirmation. Thursday and Friday are "unknown" because they are unverified, so they render nothing.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Optional channels and map coordinates are empty</b> until verified and never render while empty. A map is a static image plus links, never a third-party embed (zero third-party requests).</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Two roles only</b> (Owner, Editor), as approved. Login security follows the Stage 0 doc: Argon2id or bcrypt, throttling, Secure/HttpOnly/SameSite=Strict cookies, admin on the .ir host only.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>The logo slot</b> holds the temporary concentric mark (Q3) until the real SVG arrives. Uploaded SVGs are sanitised with an allow-list.</span></li>
  <li><span><b>Backups (D13):</b> daily database dump plus media manifest, rotated 7/4/3, with a weekly off-site download reminder. Restore is Owner-only, takes a safety backup first, and runs while the static site keeps serving.</span></li>
</ol>
{% endcall %}

{# ───────────────────────── A9 MOBILE INQUIRIES ───────────────────────── #}
{% call screen('A9', 'mobile', 'Mobile triage', 'استعلام‌ها روی موبایل', 'The admin is responsive, but only triage is designed mobile-first: read an inquiry, call or WhatsApp, change its status. Heavy editing such as spec tables and publishing stays desktop-first.') %}
<div class="phones" dir="rtl" lang="fa">
  <div class="phone">
    <div class="phone__top"><span class="burger"></span><b>استعلام‌ها</b><span class="dot"></span><span style="font-size:12px">۷ تغییر</span></div>
